      "text": "Goal: Ai-drive, and natural-languge producing draw.\n\nMethods:\n- Programming language for 3d printner.\n- From PNG to STL and beyond.\n\nResults:\n- A reproducible, details-oriainted, and adjustable outcome.\n- Consumes <100k tokens\n\n",
